      "equation_id": "E1",
      "latex": "\\rho_j c_j \\frac{T_i^{n+1} - T_i^n}{\\Delta t} = k_j \\frac{T_{i+1}^n - 2T_i^n + T_{i-1}^n}{\\Delta x^2}",
